<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">- Kwere Bible Velsion</book>
  <para style="h">Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Amo</para>
  <para style="mt">Amosi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino china usenga wa mulotezi Amosi. Mulotezi Amosi kakala kodima wanyama (sula ya 1:1) na iviya kakala mulimaji (sula ya 7:14). Baho Mulungu kamtanga yawe mulotezi wake. Amosi kalawa bululu da Tekoa, uko kakala muna ufalume wa kusi wa Yuda. Mbali usenga wake mvunyo ukala ulungiligwa ufalume wa kasikazi wa Isilaili. Amosi kalotela lusita Uzia viyakalile mfalume wa Yuda na Yeloboamu wekaidi kakala mfalume wa Isilaili. Lusita ulwo lodahika lukala mwaka 750 KK, yang'hali Chilisito hanavumbuka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amosi kalotela kuhumizigwa kwa zisi nyingi muna isula ya 1-2, mbali usenga wake mkulu usonhela Isilaili. Lukala lusita lwa kumweda kwa Waisilaili. Lusita lwa kumweda uko wamzimiza Mulungu na wawagaza wanhu welibule chinhu (sula ya 2:6). Nhaguso ya Mulungu kumwawo ikala wasoligwe na wagaligwe kuutumwa (sula ya 7:17). Mbali Mulungu kawalahila kuwa kezawataza wanhu wake wa Isilaili kuhuma kaidi zisi zose ziwazitawale baho hachisogo (sula ya 9:12).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Mwanduso Amosi koilagusa.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Maabaho muna isula ya 1-2 kogong'onda nhaguso kwa zisi zimwenga.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Muna isula ya 3 mbaka sula ya 9:11 zolonga kusonhela nhaguso na kuwagala Waisilaili kuutumwa.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kuuhelelo muna isula ya 9:12-15, Mulungu kolonga kuwa kezawabweleza wanhu wokwaminika wasigale muna iisi ya Isilaili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="AMO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 1:1" />Mbuli ya Amosi, imwe wa wadimaji wa wanyama wa bululu da Tekoa. Mulungu kamgubulila Amosi mbuli zino zose kuwasonhela Waisilaili miyaka midi ding'hali hadinalawilila gudemeko da isi. Lusita ulwo Uzia kakala mfalume wa Yuda na Yeloboamu mwana Yehoashi kakala mfalume wa Isilaili.<verse eid="AMO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso ya Mulungu kwa zisi zimwenga zili habehi na Isilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 1:2" />Amosi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:2">“Mndewa Mulungu koduma kulawa mulima Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:2">kolava dizi jake kulawa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:2">mbaka migunda ya mgina ya wadimaji yonyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:2">misavu ya mulima wa Kalimeli yonyala.”<verse eid="AMO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 1:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:3">“Wanhu wa Damasiki wagendelela kuhasanya ng'hani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:3">ivo sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:3">kwaviya wawakanhakanha wanhu wa Gileadi fana wokanha vinhu vihandigwe mumgunda kwa magembe na via va zuma.<verse eid="AMO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 1:4" />Baho nizatuma moto muna ikaye ya Hazaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:4">wondauzitimbule mhongono za Beni Hadadi.<verse eid="AMO 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 1:5" />Nizaubena lwivi lukulu lwa bululu da Damasiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:5">na kumsegeza mtawala wa kolongo da Aveni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:5">yotawala Besi Edeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:5">Wanhu wa Shamu wezagaligwa kuuhami uko Kili.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:5">Mndewa Mulungu kalonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso ya Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 1:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:6">“Wanhu wa Gaza wagendelela kuhasanya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:6">ivo sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:6">Wawagwila wanhu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:6">na wawachuuza fana watumwa kwa Waedomu.<verse eid="AMO 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 1:7" />Ivo nizatuma moto muna zing'huta za bululu da Gaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:7">wondautimbule mhongono zake.<verse eid="AMO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 1:8" />Nizamsegeza mtawala wa bululu da Ashidodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:8">yokwamha fimbo ya chifalume umo Ashikeloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:8">Nizagolosa mkono wangu kuditagusa bululu da Ekiloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:8">Wafilisiti wose wasigale wezanangigwa.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:8">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso ya wanhu wa Tilo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 1:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:9">“Wanhu wa Tilo wagendelela kuhasanya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:9">ivo sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:9">Wawagwila wanhu wengi na kuwagala Edomu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:9">Hawategeleze lagano da umbwiya diwatendile.<verse eid="AMO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 1:10" />Ivo nizatuma moto muna zing'huta za bululu da Tilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:10">wondautimbule mhongono zake.”<verse eid="AMO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 1:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:11">“Wanhu wa Edomu wagendelela kuhasanya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:11">ivo sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:11">Wawasepa ndugu zawo kwa mazele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:11">walema kuwawonela ubazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:11">Ludoko lwawo longezeka lusita lose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:11">na ng'hasiliki zawo ziiyoha siku zose.<verse eid="AMO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 1:12" />Ivo nizatuma moto muna dibululu da Temani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:12">wondautimbule mhongono za Bosila.”<verse eid="AMO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 1:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:13">“Wana wa Amoni wagendelela kuhasanya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:13">ivo sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:13">Muna ing'hondo yawo ya kusola isi, wawatula izinda wanaake weli na wimo muna iisi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="AMO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 1:14" />Ivo nizatuma moto muna zing'huta za mabululu ya Laba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:14">wondauzitimbule mhongono zake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:14">Siku iyo ya ng'hondo, kwizakuwa na kuguta ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:14">keyakeya dizakuwa kulu fana vulavumbi.<verse eid="AMO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 1:15" />Mfalume wa Amoni kezahita kuutumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:15">hamwe na vinyandama wake wose.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:15">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="AMO 2" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 2:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:1">“Wamoabu wagendelela kuhasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:1">ivo sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:1">Kwaviya wasoma mavuha ya mfalume wa Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:1">mbaka yawa maivu.<verse eid="AMO 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 2:2" />Nizatuma moto muna iisi ya Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:2">wondautimbule mhongono za bululu da Keliosi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:2">Wanhu wa Moabu wezadanganika uko kuna zinyangi za ng'hondo na dizi da mhalati.<verse eid="AMO 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 2:3" />Nizamkoma mfalume wa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:3">hamwe na vinyandama wake wose.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:3">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso ya wanhu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 2:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:4">“Wanhu wa Yuda wagendelela kuhasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:4">ivo sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:4">Kwaviya wayaleka malagilizo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:4">na hawayazindilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:4">Wavwiziligwa na milungu ija ija ya wasaho zawo wadanganike.<verse eid="AMO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 2:5" />Nizatuma moto muna iisi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:5">wondautimbule mhongono za Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="AMO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso ya wanhu wa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 2:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:6">“Wanhu wa Isilaili wagendelela kuhasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:6">ivo sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:6">Wawachuuza kwa hela wanhu welibule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:6">na ngayengaye kwa vilatu.<verse eid="AMO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 2:7" />Wowabojoga ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:7">na wowakimilila sekewapate haki zawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:7">Munhu na tati yake wombandama mndele imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:7">ivo hawadihishimu zina jangu jelile.<verse eid="AMO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 2:8" />Habehi ya chila lupango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:8">wanhu wogonela mawalo yowekile lehani ngayengaye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:8">Muna ikaye ya Mulungu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:8">wong'wa divai yowaigulile kwa hela ziwapatile kwa ngayengaye.<verse eid="AMO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 2:9" />Niwananga Waamoli haulongozi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:9">nawo wakala watali fana mibiki ya mielezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:9">wagangamala fana mibiki ya miyaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:9">Niyananga matunda yawo na mazizi yawo.<verse eid="AMO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 2:10" />Nimulavani muna iisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:10">nimulongozani kufosa muna ichuwala kwa miyaka malongo mane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:10">mbaka mwiisola isi ya Waamoli kuwa yenu.<verse eid="AMO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 2:11" />Nisagula walotezi muna iwanenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:11">na wamwenga muna iwabwanga wenu kuwa Wanazili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Munhu yoyose yoika hakwe kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu, kwa Chiebulaniya kotangigwa Mnazili.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:11">Mweye Waisilaili, vino mbuli zonilonga siyo za kweli?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:11">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 2:12" />“Mweye muwang'wiza divai Wanazili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:12">na muwalongela walotezi sekewalotele.<verse eid="AMO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 2:13" />Ivo nizamuhondani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:13">fana viya tololi dimemile ndiya vidihonda vinhu lusita vodifosa.<verse eid="AMO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 2:14" />Na wanhu wodaha kukimbila ng'hani hawezadaha kwiibanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:14">wanhu weli na nguvu wezamalilwa na nguvu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:14">iviya magalu hawadaha kukombola ugima wawo.<verse eid="AMO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 2:15" />Woitowela misale kuna ing'hondo hawezadaha kwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:15">wanhu wodaha kukimbila ng'hani, hawezadaha kwiikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:15">na wakwelafalasi kwiing'hondo hawezadaha kuukombola ugima wawo.<verse eid="AMO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 2:16" />Siku iyo wakalizi magalu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:16">wezakimbila ukengele.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 2:16">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="AMO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 3:1" />Mweye Waisilaili, tegelezeni mbuli iyalongile Mndewa Mulungu kusonhela mweye. Tegelezeni mweye Waisilaili mose wonimulavileni Misili,<verse eid="AMO 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 3:2" />“Muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:2">nimsagulani mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:2">ivo nizamtagusani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:2">kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wenu wose.”<verse eid="AMO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya mulotezi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 3:3" />Vino wanhu waidi wodaha kugenda hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:3">bila ya kuilumba?<verse eid="AMO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 3:4" />Vino simba kotongoloma kumbago one hanapata nyama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:4">Vino simba mkali kotongoloma muna dituka jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:4">one hanagwila chinhu?<verse eid="AMO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 3:5" />Vino ndege kodaha kwenzeka muna umtego ulibule chambo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:5">Vino mtego wodaha kufatuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:5">one haudalisigwe na chochose?<verse eid="AMO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 3:6" />Vino mhalati ya ng'hondo yolila kuna dibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:6">wanhu hawagudemeka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:6">Vino one bululu dahapata hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:6">hadigaligwe na Mndewa Mulungu?<verse eid="AMO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 3:7" />Kweli Mndewa Mulungu hatenda chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:7">bila kuwagubulila wasang'hani wake walotezi.<verse eid="AMO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 3:8" />Simba katongoloma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:8">Vino yelihi hadumba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:8">Mndewa Mulungu wetu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:8">yelihi yolema kuulonga usenga wake?<verse eid="AMO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunangigwa kwa Samalia</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 3:9" />Gong'ondeni muna zimhongono za Ashidodi na mhongono za isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:9">“Iduganyeni kuna imilima ya Samalia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:9">Mulole mbuli zihile zitendigwa uko na wanhu wogazigwa uko.”<verse eid="AMO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 3:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:10">“Wanhu wangu hawavimanyile kutenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:10">muna zikaye zawo wamemeza vinhu vihile viwabawile.”<verse eid="AMO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 3:11" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:11">“Wehi wezaizinga isi yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:11">wezamuhokani mhongono zenu na kuzinanga.”<verse eid="AMO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 3:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:12">“Fana viya mdimi viyokombola muna umulomo wa simba mivuha midi ya mgulu hebu chihande cha gutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:12">ivo niivo Waisilaili vondawakomboligwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:12">Waja wokala Samalia vondawakomboligwe wezasigala na chihande cha komwa na chihande cha chigoda muhala.”<verse eid="AMO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 3:13" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na udahi kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:13">“Tegelezeni, mkawazume welesi wa Yakobo.<verse eid="AMO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 3:14" />Siku yondaniwataguse Waisilaili kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi uwatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:14">nizalunanga chila lupango lwa Beseli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:14">nizakanha mahembe ya chila lupango na kuyagwisa hasi.<verse eid="AMO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 3:15" />Nizazinanga kaye zose muna yamabululu na vibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:15">nizazibomola kaye zihambigwe kwa meno ya nhembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:15">kaye ng'hulu zizakugwa.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:15">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="AMO 4" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 4:1" />Tegelezeni mbuli ino, mweye wanaake wose mnenehe fana viya ng'ombe wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:1">wowokala uchanyha ya mulima wa Samalia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:1">Mweye mowawonela ngayengaye na wanhu welibule watazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:1">na kuwalongela walume zenu, “Muchigalile divai ching'we.”<verse eid="AMO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 4:2" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu nyelile niilaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:2">“Siku zokwiza wanhu vondawambululeni na ndwano ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:2">chila imwe vimwili fana somba muna indwano.<verse eid="AMO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 4:3" />Mweye mwizalawa hanhu habomoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:3">chila muke dimwe kwa dimwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:3">Na mweye mwizakwasigwa uko Halimoni.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:3">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 4:4" />“Mweye Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:4">hiteni Beseli mkatende uhasanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:4">Hiteni Giligali mkongeze uhasanyi wenu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:4">Laveni nhambiko zenu chila imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:4">na zaka zenu chila siku yetatu.<verse eid="AMO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 4:5" />Mulave nhosa ya hewela ya magate yagumigwe lusu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:5">mugong'onde chila hanhu kuwa mulava nhambiko ya kulonda wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:5">kwaviya mweye Waisilaili mulonda kutenda ivo.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:5">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 4:6" />“Nigala nzala muna yamabululu na vibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:6">mbali hamunibwelele.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:6">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 4:7" />“Viikalile ing'hali miyezi mitatu kufika lusita lwa kugobola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:7">simgalileni mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:7">mbali nigala mvula muna dibululu dimwenga na bululu dimwenga sidigalile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:7">Mgunda umwe upata mvula na umwenga upuwa mbaka unyala.<verse eid="AMO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 4:8" />Wanhu wa mabululu maidi hebu matatu, waibululila kuna dibululu dimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:8">muladi wapate mazi mbali hayafaiye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:8">Mbali hamunibwelele.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:8">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 4:9" />“Nimgalilani hulo da ng'hangu na chimvuguya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:9">Ninyaza vizi venu na migunda yenu ya mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:9">Nzige waja minhini yenu na mizaituni yenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:9">Mbali hamunibwelele.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:9">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 4:10" />“Nimgalilani hulo kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:10">fana doniwagalile Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:10">Niwakoma wabwanga wenu kwiing'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:10">Nisola falasi wenu wa ng'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:10">Mitufi imema muna yamalago yenu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:10">na vundo jake dimema muna zimhula zenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:10">Mbali hamunibwelele.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:10">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 4:11" />“Niwananga wamwenga wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:11">fana vininangile Sodoma na Gomola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:11">Wahonyokwe wakala fana chibiki chisegezigwe muna umoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:11">mbali hamunibwelele.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:11">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 4:12" />“Ivo mweye Waisilaili, nizamtagusani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:12">Kwaviya nizatenda ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:12">muisasale kuiting'hana na niye kutagusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:12">niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu.”<verse eid="AMO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 4:13" />Mulungu niiyo yekile milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">iviya keka beho kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">niiyo yomulongela munhu chiya choyogesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">niiyo yogalula imisi kuwa ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">na kubojoga milima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi niijo zina jake.<verse eid="AMO 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="AMO 5" />
  <para style="s">Amosi koiyalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 5:1" />Mweye Waisilaili, tegelezeni vonimulililani.<verse eid="AMO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 5:2" />Weye mhambe Isilaili!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:2">Kudanganika na hwizakwinuka kaidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:2">Kulekigwa wiidumwe muna iisi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:2">habule munhu wa kukwinula.<verse eid="AMO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 5:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:3">“Kumwenu mweye Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:3">wanhu 1,000 wezahita kuitowa kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:3">mbali wezabwela wanhu gana muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:3">Wanhu gana wezahita kuitowa kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:3">mbali wezabwela wanhu longo muhala.”<verse eid="AMO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 5:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kowalongela Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:4">“Izoni kumwangu mwizakuwa wagima.<verse eid="AMO 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 5:5" />Mbali sekemuhite kutambika uko Beseli hebu Giligali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:5">hebu sekemuloke kuhita Belisheba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:5">Kwaviya wakaya wa Giligali kweli wezagaligwa kuuhami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:5">na bululu da Beseli dizanangigwa.”<verse eid="AMO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 5:6" />Hiteni kwa Mndewa Mulungu na mwizakuwa wagima!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:6">One siivo, kezawananga welesi wa Yosefu fana moto vouzipuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:6">wondauwatimbule wakaya wa Beseli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:6">na habule munhu yondayadahe kuuzima.<verse eid="AMO 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 5:7" />Mweye mugalula kuhumiza voilondeka kuwa daka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:7">na kuiwona haki fana unyolodo.<verse eid="AMO 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 5:8" />Iyo yatendile vibugulu va nhondo zitangigwa Chilimila na Homauhome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">yogalula ziza totolo kuwa imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">na imisi kuwa ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">yoduganya mazi ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">na kuyetila muna iisi inyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">Mndewa Mulungu niijo zina jake.<verse eid="AMO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 5:9" />Yeye niiyo yowananga weli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:9">na kubananga mhongono zawo zigangamale.<verse eid="AMO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 5:10" />Mweye mowehila wanhu wohumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:10">na mowehila waja wolonga ukweli kuna ichitala.<verse eid="AMO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 5:11" />Mweye mowabamanya ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">na mowalonda wamwing'heni kodi ya ngano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">Moizengela kaye ya mabwe ya kusongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">mbali mweye hamwizakala umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">Molima vizi vinogile va mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">mbali hamwizakung'wa divai yake.<verse eid="AMO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 5:12" />Kwaviya niye nivimanya viya vimbanange ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:12">na ukulu wa uhasanyi wenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:12">Mweye mowagaza wanhu wanogile na mohokela lushwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:12">na kukimilila ngayengaye sekewahumizigwe voilondeka kwiichitala.<verse eid="AMO 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 5:13" />Ivo munhu yeli na ubala kezanyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:13">kwaviya lusita ulo lwiha.<verse eid="AMO 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 5:14" />Molondeka muleke kutenda mbuli zihile na mutende mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:14">muladi muwe wagima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:14">One muhatenda ivo, Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:14">kezakuwa hamwe na mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:14">fana vimulonga.<verse eid="AMO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 5:15" />Muzihile mbuli zihile na mulonde mbuli zinogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:15">Muhumize voilondeka muna ichitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:15">yodahika Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:15">kezawatendela mbuli zinogile wanhu wasigale wa kabila da Yosefu.<verse eid="AMO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 5:16" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:16">“Wanhu wezalila muna zinzila zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:16">Wezalila, ‘Chizagaya! Chizagaya!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:16">Walimi wezatangigwa kwiza kulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:16">magalu wa kulila wezakwiza kulila.<verse eid="AMO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 5:17" />Wanhu wezalila muna imigunda yose ya mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:17">kwaviya nizafosa hagati yenu kumtagusani.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:17">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="AMO 5:18" />Mweye womuigozela ng'hani siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:18">habali moilonda ng'hani siku iyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:18">Siku iyo izakuwa siku ya ziza siyo ya bung'hulo.<verse eid="AMO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="AMO 5:19" />Izakuwa fana munhu yakimbile simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:19">maabaho koiting'hana na duma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:19">Izakuwa fana munhu yobwela kuna ikaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:19">na kwika mkono wake muna nhumba na kulumigwa na zoka.<verse eid="AMO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="AMO 5:20" />Siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa izakuwa siku ya ziza totolo siyo ya bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:20">Izakuwa siku ya magayo siyo ya kudeng'helela.<verse eid="AMO 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="AMO 5:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:21">“Noyehila na noyehula madugila yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:21">siideng'helela miting'hano yenu ya kutambika.<verse eid="AMO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="AMO 5:22" />One muhanilavila nhambiko zenu za kutimbula na nhosa za mhule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:22">sizatogola kuzihokela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:22">na nhambiko zenu za kugala tindiwalo za wanyama wanenehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:22">sizazilola!<verse eid="AMO 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="AMO 5:23" />Lekeni kwimba kwa kulandula dizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:23">Silonda kuhulika nyila za vinubi venu.<verse eid="AMO 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="AMO 5:24" />Mbali lekeni kuhumiza voilondeka kukilime fana mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:24">kutenda mbuli zinogile kuwe fana lwanda halunyala.<verse eid="AMO 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="AMO 5:25" />“Mweye Waisilaili, lusita luja vimukalile kudibwilingu miyaka malongo mane. Vino munigalila nhosa na nhambiko ya kutimbula hata mwanza umwe? <verse eid="AMO 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="AMO 5:26" />Muitambikila milungu ya uvwizi ya Sikusi, yeli mfalume wenu, iviya Chiyuni mulungu wenu wa nhondo. Mutambikila vinhu vomuvitendile wenyewo. <verse eid="AMO 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="AMO 5:27" />Ivo nizamgalani kuuhami kutali kufosa bululu da Damasiki!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 5:27">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="AMO 6" />
  <para style="s">Wezagaya waja woilegeha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 6:1" />Mwizagaya mweye womuilegeha uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:1">na mweye mukala hana ihanhu hanogile kuna umulima wa Samalia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:1">mweye mowoneka watawala wa isi ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:1">Waisilaili wose wohita kumwenu kutazigwa.<verse eid="AMO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 6:2" />Hiteni Kaline mukalole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:2">Kulawa uko muhite kuna dibululu kulu da Hamasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:2">Maabaho muhulumuke mbaka Gasi kwa Wafilisiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:2">Vino falume zawo hazinogile kufosa izenu na isi yawo haili ng'hulu kufosa iyenu?<verse eid="AMO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 6:3" />Moyehula siku ija ihile ikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:3">mbali kwa kusang'hana usede molopola kugala magayo.<verse eid="AMO 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 6:4" />Mwizagaya mweye mugonela makomwa ya meno ya nhembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:4">na kwiigolosa uchanyha ya makomwa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:4">kuno moja nyama za wanang'hondolo na nyama za madang'ang'a.<verse eid="AMO 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 6:5" />Mweye molonda kwimba chakachaka na madizi ya vinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:5">na kutenda via vimwenga va nyila kwa kumuhiga mfalume Daudi.<verse eid="AMO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 6:6" />Mong'wa divai muna yamahamha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:6">na moiboboda mavuta yonung'hila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:6">mbali hamwizakuwa na usungu Waisilaili vondawagazigwe.<verse eid="AMO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 6:7" />Mwizakuwa wa mwanduso kuhita kuuhami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:7">na madugila yenu ya kuilegeha yezamala.<verse eid="AMO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 6:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kailaha kwa muhe wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:8">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:8">“Noyehila ng'hani magoda ya welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:8">iviya nozihila mhongono zawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:8">Bululu jawo na vinhu vose vili umo, nizaweng'ha wehi wawo.”<verse eid="AMO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 6:9" />One wanhu longo wahasigala muna ikaye imwe, wose wezadanganika. <verse eid="AMO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 6:10" />One yaheza ndugu wa wanhu wadanganike kuilava mitufi kunze isomigwe na kumuuza yoyose yondayawe muna ikaye, “Vino kuna munhu imwenga hamwe na weye?” Nayo kezamwidika, “Aka!” Ndugu iyo kezamulongela, “Nyamala hupi! Sekechiditambule zina da Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="AMO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 6:11" />Lola! Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kolagiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:11">kaye ng'hulu yotulika vihande vihande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:11">kaye ndodo yokeng'enheka.<verse eid="AMO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 6:12" />Vino falasi wodaha kukimbila muna yamabwe makulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:12">Vino munhu kodaha kulima bahali kwa ng'ombe walume?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:12">Mbali mweye mugalula kuhumiza voilondeka kuwa fana daka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:12">na tunda da haki kuwa usungu.<verse eid="AMO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 6:13" />Mweye modeng'helela kudihuma bululu da Lodebali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:13">kuno molonga, “Vino hachidisolile bululu da Kalinaimu kwa nguvu zetu wenyewo?”<verse eid="AMO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 6:14" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:14">“Mweye Waisilaili, kweli nizawagala wanhu wa isi imwenga weze kumtowani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:14">Wanhu wawo wezamgazani kwandusila kasikazi ya Lebohamasi mbaka chizanda cha Alaba chili ubanzi wa kusi.”<verse eid="AMO 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="AMO 7" />
  <para style="s">Nzige, chilaguso cha mwanduso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 7:1" />Mbuli zino niizo zoyanilaguse Mndewa Mulungu. Nimuwona Mulungu kolumba nzige, lusita wanhu viwakomeleze kuwakanhila mgina wanyama wa mfalume. Lusita ulo mgina ukala wosuka kaidi. <verse eid="AMO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 7:2" />Niwona nzige wawo woja na kukomeleza mayani yose muna iisi. Maabaho nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:2">“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba uchilekelele!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:2">Vino Welesi wa Yakobo wodahaze kuwa wagima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:2">Wawo wanyondenyonde ng'hani!”<verse eid="AMO 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 7:3" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kagalula lungilo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:3">kalonga, “Mbuli iyo haizalawilila.”<verse eid="AMO 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moto, chilaguso chekaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 7:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilagusa chilaguso chimwenga. Nimuwona Mndewa Mulungu koutanga moto wize kuwatagusa wanhu. Moto uwo unyaza vilindi va bahali, wandusa kutimbula isi inyalile. <verse eid="AMO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 7:5" />Maabaho nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:5">“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba uleke kutagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:5">Vino welesi wa Yakobo wodahaze kuwa wagima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:5">Wawo wanyondenyonde ng'hani!”<verse eid="AMO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 7:6" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kagalula lungilo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:6">kalonga, “Mbuli iyo haizalawilila.”<verse eid="AMO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timazi, chilaguso cheketatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 7:7" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilagusa chilaguso chimwenga. Niwona Mndewa Mulungu kakala yemile habehi na ng'huta, kamha luzabi lwake luli na timazi.<verse eid="AMO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 7:8" />Nayo kaniuza, “Amosi kowona choni?” Nimwidika, “Nowona timazi.” Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:8">“Nokwika timazi ino kwa wanhu wangu Waisilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:8">Sizagalula lungilo jangu da kuwatagusa.<verse eid="AMO 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 7:9" />Kuja kuna ivilima kowotambika welesi wa Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:9">kwizanangigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:9">na chila hanhu ha kutambikila ha Waisilaili hezakuwa matongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:9">Nizawananga welesi wa mfalume Yeloboamu kwa zele.”<verse eid="AMO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amosi na Amazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 7:10" />Maabaho Amazia mkulu wa nhambiko wa Beseli katuma usenga kwa mfalume Yeloboamu wa Isilaili, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:10">“Amosi kogala udelenya kumwako weye mfalume wa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:10">Wanhu hawadaha kufunyila umoyo mbuli zake.<verse eid="AMO 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 7:11" />Yeye kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:11">‘Mfalume Yeloboamu kezadanganika kwa zele na Waisilaili wezagaligwa kuuhami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:11">kutali ng'hani na isi yawo.’ ”<verse eid="AMO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 7:12" />Maabaho Amazia kamulongela Amosi, “Weye mulotezi, sambi chikulegela, segela. Hita kuna iisi ya Yuda, ukalotele uko na upate ndiya. <verse eid="AMO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 7:13" />Sekeulotele kaidi hano Beseli, kwaviya hano hanhu ha kutambikila ha chifalume howotambikila wanhu wa isi yose.”<verse eid="AMO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 7:14" />Amosi kamwidika Amazia, “Niye siyo mulotezi wa kulihigwa na siyo imwe wa chibumbila cha walotezi. Niye mdimi na ndolezi wa mikuyu. <verse eid="AMO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 7:15" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kanilava muna isang'hano yangu ya kudima ng'hondolo na kanilongela, ‘Hita ukawalotele wanhu wangu Waisilaili.’ <verse eid="AMO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 7:16" />Lelo weye Amazia, tegeleza mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu. Weye konilongela sekenilotele kusonhela Waisilaili na sekenilonge mbuli yoyose kusonhela welesi wa Isaka.<verse eid="AMO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 7:17" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:17">‘Muke wako kezakuwa malaya muna dibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:17">wanago wa chilume na wanago wa chike wezakomigwa kuna ing'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:17">Isi yako wezagoleligwa wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:17">weye mwenyewo kwizadanganikila muna iisi ya chigeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:17">kweli Waisilaili wezagaligwa kuuhami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:17">kutali ng'hani na isi yawo.’ ”<verse eid="AMO 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="AMO 8" />
  <para style="s">Chigelo cha matunda, chilaguso chekane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 8:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilagusa chilaguso chimwenga. Niwona chigelo chimemile matunda yevile. <verse eid="AMO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 8:2" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kaniuza, “Amosi kowona choni?” Nimwidika, “Nowona chigelo chili na matunda yevile.” Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela, “Uhelelo wa wanhu wangu Waisilaili ufika, sizawawonela ubazi.” <verse eid="AMO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 8:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:3">“Siku iyo nyila za kaye ya Mulungu zizagaluka kuwa ndilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:3">kwizakuwa na mitufi mingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:3">iviya mitufi iyo izakwasigwa chila hanhu chihupihupi.”<verse eid="AMO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 8:4" />Mutegeleze mweye muwawonela wanhu wolonda kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:4">na mowagaza ngayengaye wa isi.<verse eid="AMO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 8:5" />Moiuzagiza muna imizoyo yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:5">“Dugila da mwezi ukwima dizasegela zuwaki muladi chidahe kuchuuza ndiya zetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:5">Siku ya Mhumulo izamala zuwaki, muladi chidahe kuchuuza ngano yetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:5">Chizahunguza ningo na kongeza bei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:5">ivo chizawavwizila wanhu kwa ningo hazifaya.<verse eid="AMO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 8:6" />Chizawagula ngayengaye kwa hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:6">iviya chizawagula welibule chinhu kwa bei ya vilatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:6">chizachuuza makang'ha ya ngano hamwe na ngano.”<verse eid="AMO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 8:7" />Mndewa Mulungu yeli ukulu wa Yakobo kailaha, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:7">“Kweli sizazimiza sang'hano zawo zihile ziwatendile.<verse eid="AMO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 8:8" />Ivo isi izagudemeka na chila munhu mwiisi kezakuwa na ndilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:8">isi yose izakwela na kuhulumuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:8">fana mazi ya lwanda lwa Naili lwa Misili viyomema na kuhunguka.”<verse eid="AMO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 8:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:9">“Siku iyo nizatenda zuwa diswe imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:9">na nizagala ziza imisi muna iisi.<verse eid="AMO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 8:10" />Nizahindula madugila yenu kuwa ndilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:10">na nyila zenu za deng'ho kuwa giyogiyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:10">Nizamvazani maguniya yolagusa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:10">na nizamuwegulani matwi yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:10">fana kuwa na giyogiyo da ndilo ya mwana yeli imwe muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:10">Uhelelo wa siku iyo wizakuwa wa usungu mkulu ng'hani.”<verse eid="AMO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 8:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:11">“Siku zokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:11">vondanigale nzala muna iisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:11">Siyo nzala ya ndiya hebu ng'hilu ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:11">mbali nzala ya kuhulika mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="AMO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 8:12" />“Wanhu wezawegela kulawa bahali mbaka bahali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:12">na kulawa ubanzi wa kasikazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:12">mbaka ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:12">Wezakimbila uko na uko kuzahila mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:12">mbali hawezaiwona.<verse eid="AMO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 8:13" />Siku iyo wandele wanogile na wabwanga wezasinduka kwa ng'hilu.<verse eid="AMO 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 8:14" />Waja woilaha kwa chinyala cha mulungu wa uvwizi wa Samalia, kwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:14">‘Fana milungu ya uko Dani voikala,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:14">hebu ‘Fana mulungu wa Belisheba viyokala’,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 8:14">wawo iviya wezadanganika na hawezakwinuka kaidi.”<verse eid="AMO 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="AMO 9" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wezatagusigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 9:1" />Nimuwona Mndewa Mulungu kema mumgwazo wa lupango, kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:1">“Zitowe mhanda za kaye ya Mulungu mbaka vandusilo vake vitingisike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:1">Ubene mhanda ziwagwile wanhu muna yamatwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:1">Waja wondawasigale nizawakoma kwa zele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:1">habule hata imwe yondayasulupuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:1">Habule hata imwe yondayakimbile.<verse eid="AMO 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 9:2" />Wahaihimbila kombo da kuhita kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:2">nizawagwila kwa mkono wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:2">One wahakwela kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:2">nizawahulumusa kulawa uko.<verse eid="AMO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 9:3" />One wahaifisa uchanyha ya mulima Kalimeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:3">nizawazahila na nizawalava uko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:3">One wahaifisa kuna yamazi mengi ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:3">nizalagiliza zoka diwalume.<verse eid="AMO 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 9:4" />One wehi wawo wahawagala kuuhami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:4">uko iviya nizalagiliza wakomigwe na mazele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:4">Nizawabunhulila meso yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:4">nizawaduwila siyo kuwatemela mate.”<verse eid="AMO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 9:5" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:5">kodalisa isi nayo yolumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:5">wanhu wose wokala umo wokuwa na giyogiyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:5">Isi yose yokwela na kuhumuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:5">fana viya lwanda lwa Naili lwa Misili vilumema na kuhunguka.<verse eid="AMO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 9:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kazenga viheleto vake kuulanga na kwika vandusilo vake muna iisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:6">Yeye koyatanga mazi ya bahali na koyetila muna iisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:6">Mndewa Mulungu niijo zina jake.<verse eid="AMO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 9:7" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Vino mweye Waisilaili kumwangu siyo fana Wakushi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:7">Vino siwalavile Waisilaili kuna iisi ya Misili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:7">Iviya siwalavile Wafilisiti kulawa kuna iisi ya Kafitoli na Washami kulawa kuna iisi ya Kili?<verse eid="AMO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 9:8" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu noulola ufalume uli na uhasanyi na nizaunanga ulawe muna iisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:8">Mbali sizawananga welesi wose wa Yakobo.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:8">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 9:9" />Nizalava lagilizo na kuwabeta Waisilaili muna izisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:9">fana viya munhu viyobeta ngano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:9">muladi niwasegeze wose weli hawafaya.<verse eid="AMO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 9:10" />Weli na uhasanyi mwa iwanhu wangu, wezakomigwa na zele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:10">wawo wolonga, “Uzidilwa hawizachipata na hawizachifika.”<verse eid="AMO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ufalume wa Daudi wobwelezigwa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 9:11" />Siku yokwiza vondaniisimike kaye ya Daudi igwile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:11">Nizatenda ng'huta zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:11">na kuzenga kaidi matongo yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:11">Nizaizenga kaidi fana viikalile ichanduso,<verse eid="AMO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 9:12" />muladi wawatawale Waedomu wasigale na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga zikalile zangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:12">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 9:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">“Siku zokwiza ndiya zizakuwa nyingi mbaka walimi wezapotwa kugobola zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">Iviya zabibu zizakuwa nyingi mbaka wakamaji wezapotwa kukama zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">Milima izalava divai inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">vilima vizakilima divai.<verse eid="AMO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 9:14" />Nizawabweleza kaidi wanhu wangu Waisilaili wahamizigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">Wezazenga kaidi mabululu yalekigwe matongo na wezakala umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">Wezahanda mizabibu na kung'wa divai yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">Wezalima migunda na kuja ndiya zake.<verse eid="AMO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 9:15" />Nizaweka Waisilaili muna iisi yawo wenyewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:15">Hawezasegezigwa muna iisi iniweng'hile.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:15">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="AMO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 9" />
</usx>